WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.375
Meet anmerko. Turn website feedback into a clear
brief for your AI agent.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.912
Point to an element. Add a comment.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.684
Capture a screenshot, or leave feedback for the
whole page.

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:17.808
Then copy your prompt, with the page context
included.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.022
Paste it into your AI agent. You're ready to go.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.658
Easy, universal, and private. Try anmerko at
anmerko dot com.
